OL,3,GNEWSAGive people 'reasons to spend
OL,4,Atime' on High Street
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP has called for ideas to boost a
OL,7,Ftown centre hit by the planned
OL,8,Fdeparture of its Marks & Spencer (M&S)
OL,9,Fstore.
OL,11,FLabour's Josh MacAlister claimed the
OL,12,Fdecision by M&S to shut its Pow Street
OL,13,Fshop and relocate to Derwent Drive was
OL,14,Fa "vote of confidence" in Workington,
OL,15,Fbut Mark Fryer, leader of
OL,16,FLabour-controlled Cumberland Council,
OL,17,Fcalled it a disappointment.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
