OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAGive people 'reasons to spend
OL,4,Atime' on High Street
OL,5,
OL,6,FMacAlister, who has launched a survey
OL,7,Fasking residents what would encourage
OL,8,Fthem to visit Workington town centre,
OL,9,Furged others not to talk the area down
OL,10,Fand said people just needed "reasons to
OL,11,Fspend time" there.
OL,13,FWorkington has received about #30m in
OL,14,Fgovernment funding to spend on its town
OL,15,Fcentre, transport links and a new
OL,16,Fsports village.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
